### 식사기록 생성 API
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/meals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "bad case 3 / solution 1",
  "imageKey": "temp/179d17b0-8c80-4346-a7ff-9a7f7580e26f.jpg",
  "mealAt": "2026-08-05T07:12:26Z",
  "iconId": 1
}

### 분석 상태 조회 API
@mealId = 10
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/meals/{{mealId}}/analysis

### 재분석 요청 API
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/meals/{{mealId}}/analysis